---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Kicker from '../../components/Kicker.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../i18n/utils';
import { academicLinks } from '../../data/research';
import portrait from '../../assets/photos/source/fernanda-portrait-2.jpg';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="About"
  description="Fernanda Guidotti Carneiro's background — from Fatec to a PhD at USP, through SENAI, teaching, and the creation of the 6C Architecture."
  path="/en/about"
>
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-start">
    <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
      <Kicker>{t('about.kicker')}</Kicker>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif-display text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
        {t('about.title')}
      </h1>
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Fernanda Guidotti Carneiro"
        width={480}
        height={600}
        class="mt-8 aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-xs rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-[0_20px_60px_-20px_rgba(22,63,66,0.35)]"
      />
      <a
        href={`mailto:${academicLinks.email}`}
        class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-petrol-600)] underline-grow dark:text-[var(--color-petrol-300)]"
      >
        {academicLinks.email} ↗
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-measure space-y-8 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark-soft)]">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
          Education
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Fernanda holds a PhD in Computer Science and Computational Mathematics from the Institute of Mathematics
          and Computer Sciences at the University of São Paulo (ICMC/USP), with a thesis defended in December 2025
          on the <strong>6C Architecture</strong>, a reference framework for Industrial Artificial Intelligence.
          Before that, she completed her master's at the same institution, proposing a base architecture for
          integrating unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) with web platforms. Her academic path began at Fatec
          Taquaritinga, in Data Processing Technology.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
          Applied research and industrial innovation
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Over more than a decade, Fernanda built her career at the intersection of academic research and industrial
          application. She worked as a research fellow in Research, Development, and Innovation (R&D&I) at SENAI
          ISI-SE (Florianópolis) and later as a senior systems analyst and researcher at SENAI ISI-SIM (São Leopoldo),
          developing architectures and AI solutions for real industrial contexts. She is currently a research fellow
          in Big Data and AI at SENAI Cimatec.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
          From research to product
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          In 2023, she became a partner and AI & Automation specialist at <strong>MaximizaIA</strong>, a startup
          where she leads the development of AI solutions applied to industry — including <strong>SmartProd</strong>,
          a Production Planning and Control system that puts the principles of the 6C Architecture into practice.
          She is also the creator of <strong>Mapa de IA</strong>, an initiative dedicated to mapping the Artificial
          Intelligence ecosystem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
          Teaching and knowledge dissemination
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Since March 2026, she has been a university lecturer at Fatec Catanduva, in the Data Science for
          Agribusiness program, advising students on data-driven technology solutions for the agribusiness sector —
          continuing a teaching path that also included the Centro Estadual de Educação Tecnológica Paula Souza, in
          Araraquara.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] dark:text-[var(--color-ink-dark)]">
          A vision: science and industry, side by side
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The common thread in Fernanda's path is the conviction that Artificial Intelligence only creates real
          value when built on solid foundations of architecture, governance, and traceability — not as isolated
          models, but as living systems capable of continuously learning from operations. This vision underlies the
          6C Architecture and guides her work across academia and industry.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
